# YOUR TASK

Write a 3-4 sentence summary for the instructor. Be factual and actionable:

1. State how the class is performing overall (use the average score and performance distribution).
2. Call out which learning goals are strongest and which need the most attention.
3. If there are common weak areas, mention them as topics the instructor may want to revisit in lecture or assign additional practice on.
4. If any students are struggling, note how many without naming them.

Write for the instructor directly ("Your class...", "Students are..."). Be concise — no bullet points, just prose.
